      "message": "Empty string is falsy, but if it\u0027s an empty string we want to set `entryPoint` to `\"\"`, not `undefined`.\n\nI think you can just do it unconditionally now, in the `desc`, instead of afterward:\n`\"entryPoint\": WebGPU.make...`\n\nSame for other 2.",
